# Google Maps JavaScript API key for the store-location picker (apply form).
# This key ships in the client bundle at build time — it is NOT a secret; lock
# it down in the Google Cloud console instead:
#   - APIs: enable "Maps JavaScript API"
#   - Application restriction: HTTP referrers → your domains
#     (e.g. https://mt-auto-seller.<subdomain>.workers.dev/*, your custom domain/*)
#   - Billing must be enabled on the Google Cloud project.
# Set the same variable in the Cloudflare build environment for deploys.
# If unset, the picker falls back to geolocation-only (no map).
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
